Changes made only for the merge:

  - the module registers itself through the host's ModuleDescriptor list
    instead of its own manifest id; its original id, "media-recorder", is
    kept alive in app.plugins.plugins so anything looking it up still finds
    it.
  - its styles.css now lives as the "Media Journal" section of the host
    root styles.css, because an Obsidian plugin loads exactly one.
